; ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
; 11/12/13 - Adjust magnetic declination so centre line
; surveys are aligned to Eur 79 grid rather than True North.
; Applying correction of -0.4 to original magnetic readings in
